      "kind": "choice",
      "question_latex": "一个等腰直角三角形，其中一个底角是（　）。",
      "options": [
        "A. \\(90^\\circ\\)",
        "B. \\(180^\\circ\\)",
        "C. \\(45^\\circ\\)",
        "D. \\(60^\\circ\\)"
      ],
      "tables": [],
      "diagrams": [],
      "answer_latex": "选C。等腰直角三角形的两个锐角相等，共\\(180^\\circ-90^\\circ=90^\\circ\\)，每个\\(90^\\circ\\div2=45^\\circ\\)。",
